The universal primitive

PTech currently frames the world as:
ASSET =C3=97 CONDITION =C3=97 PLACE =C3=97 TIME

PowPowPow effectively frames it as:
RESOURCE =C3=97 WORKLOAD =C3=97 MARKET =C3=97 TIME

Merge them into:
Opportunity =3D Asset =C3=97 State =C3=97 Action =C3=97 Place =C3=97 Time

Then define:
V(a) =3D expected economic outcome of action a

and choose:
a* =3D argmax_a V(a)

That is *Autoassign generalized to the physical economy*.

Repair is an action.

Mining is an action.

Inference is an action.

Selling is an action.

Parting-out is an action.

Installing is an action.

Replacing is an action.

Doing nothing is an action.

This should become the conceptual heart of pow.systems.
