Core conclusion
<p>PTech is already conceptually the parent of PowPowPow, while PowPowPow c=
ontains the much more mature operating machinery:</p>
<ul>
<li>immutable raw capture</li>
<li>provenance</li>
<li>versioned transforms</li>
<li>daily state</li>
<li>experiments/backtests</li>
<li>live collectors</li>
<li>a strict =E2=80=9Cevery derived number must resolve back to evidence=E2=
=80=9D doctrine</li>
</ul>
<p>So the right move is <strong>not to kill PowPowPow</strong>.</p>
<p>It is to <strong>promote the common machinery and make compute one syste=
m inside a broader physical-technology economic system</strong>.</p>



